and so when you're not

00:12:22.329 --> 00:12:24.401
looking at the fear, you're
just living in the fear

00:12:24.401 --> 00:12:25.910
and you're believing in the problem.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.658
But when you witness the
fear and you're willing

00:12:27.658 --> 00:12:29.338
